<title>BANGLADESH: Bangladesh Monno Ceramic's '96 net profit falls.</title>
<headline>Bangladesh Monno Ceramic's '96 net profit falls.</headline>
<dateline>DHAKA 1996-12-23</dateline>
<text>
<p>The year ended on June 30, 1996.</p>
<p>(In million taka unless stated)</p>
<p>					1995/96	   1994/95</p>
<p>    Net Turnover		   541.1    vs     469.5</p>
<p>    Profit before tax	     50.4    vs	65.9</p>
<p>    Net profit			41.5    vs	49.2</p>
<p>    Dividend     30 taka per 100-taka share vs  30 taka</p>
<p>Note: The company, which produces ceramic tableware, announced the results on Monday at its annual meeting. It said the net profit declined because of political unrest that hit shipments.</p>
</text>
